	<!-- ============================================================
	     Modernized Find Item window (modern window theme)
	     - filters grouped in a slate panel with short labels ("Location", "Slot", "Augment slot"...)
	       so nothing is cut off; compact slate fields with the chevron dropdown button
	     - level range on one row; Find Items is the gold primary button at the foot of the panel;
	       Reset sits in the panel header
	     - drop-to-equip character view in its own panel under the filters, with a hint label
	     - results list in a dark inset with the slim scrollbar; Item Name column widened (250)
	     - action bar: Grab / Highlight together, full-width checkbox labels with the gold checkbox,
	       Destroy Item set apart with a red outline (BDT_Danger)
	     ============================================================ -->
